Looking at the figure, the center of the circle is marked at (0, 1). The highest point of the arc is at (0, 7). The distance from the center (0, 1) to the top point (0, 7) is 7 − 1 = 6, which matches the dashed radius segment drawn from the center to the edge of the figure.

Radius = 6 units

